   "widgets_values": [
    "## song-minimax-music3\n\nSong (MiniMax Music 3, local).\n\n1. **SONG**: caption in three parts (Global Metadata / Vocal Details / Arrangement), the lyric with bare section tags.\n2. max_duration caps the length; the model picks the exact length.\n3. **SEED** = take number; make 3-4 takes.\n\nInputs in CAPITALS are the ones scripts/run_workflow.py sets.\n\n### Models\n- [minimax_music3_dit_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-Music-3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_music3_dit_fp16.safetensors)\n- [minimax_music3_text_encoder_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-Music-3/resolve/main/text_encoders/minimax_music3_text_encoder_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n- [minimax_music3_dav.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-Music-3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_music3_dav.safetensors)"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
